.IX Title "BASIC_DB_AUTH 8"
.TH BASIC_DB_AUTH 8 2026-08-25 "perl v5.42.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
